ne of the few moments where GPT-6.1 Sol was fully on target in the middle game."}, {"turn": 18, "text": "E8 was the decisive error: it lost 20.1 points and took Black's lead from +7.0 to +27.1. The engine wanted F8, the point Black took on the very next move. After that White was fighting from far behind."}, {"turn": 25, "text": "The 20k's D9 was its worst move, losing 9.3 points and cutting Black's lead from +33.3 to +24.0. It was far too little to matter, since Black was still more than 24 points ahead."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "Everything it ran read files, played the moves it named via mcp__go__play, listed chains and distinct liberties with current-position-liberties.js (inspectLiberties), counted empty regions with the areaSource function, and wrote notes and the SGF. None of it generated, ranked or looked ahead at candidate moves.", "stop": false}}